1
00:00:00,162 --> 00:00:01,962
(Howard:)What is happening?

2
00:00:01,964 --> 00:00:04,464
(Howard:)Are we missing him?

3
00:00:04,466 --> 00:00:08,066
(Bernadette:)No, that's not what
this feeling is.

4
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:10,240
(Bernadette:)Is it?

5
00:00:10,239 --> 00:00:12,639
(Howard:)Of course not.
He drove us crazy.

6
00:00:12,641 --> 00:00:14,441
(Howard:)Like when you were gonna
make that pie

7
00:00:14,443 --> 00:00:18,043
(Howard:)and Stuart ate
all the blueberries. (scoffs)

8
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:21,277
(Bernadette:)And he tried to deny it, but
his teeth were all purple.

9
00:00:23,052 --> 00:00:25,022
(Howard:)That was pretty cute.
(chuckles)

10
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,220
(Penny:)Yeah.

11
00:00:27,222 --> 00:00:29,022
Ew, we are missing him!

12
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:35,130
(Raj:)So I was thinking,
maybe we can come up with a name

13
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:37,760
(Raj:)for the asteroid by
combining our names.

14
00:00:37,766 --> 00:00:39,236
(Sheldon:)That's a great idea.

15
00:00:39,234 --> 00:00:40,734
(Sheldon:)I've got it.

16
00:00:40,736 --> 00:00:43,606
(Sheldon:)We'll call it... Cooper.

17
00:00:45,441 --> 00:00:47,071
(Raj:)How is that both our names?

18
00:00:47,076 --> 00:00:51,176
"Koo" from Koothrappali
and "per" from Cooper.

19
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,850
(Raj:)Yeah, s-so it's, like,
Kooper with a "K"?

20
00:00:53,849 --> 00:00:55,549
(Sheldon:)Nah, you're right, that's dumb.

21
00:00:56,552 --> 00:00:57,882
(Sheldon:)Hey.

22
00:00:57,886 --> 00:00:59,286
(Sheldon:)Oh, Leonard, great news.

23
00:00:59,288 --> 00:01:02,728
(Sheldon:)We discovered a medium-sized
asteroid together.

